{"eventId":"evt-000090","eventKind":"doc_section.upsert.v1","status":"accepted","decidedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:00+09:00","artifactPath":".agents/command-board.md","sectionOrder":9,"sectionId":".agents-command-board.md::0009::9.-raw-evidence-import-boundary","headingDepth":2,"headingText":"9. raw evidence import boundary","headingPath":["Command Board Contract","9. raw evidence import boundary"],"content":"## 9. raw evidence import boundary

Conversation history, ChatGPT thread body, Codex rollout, readback JSON, terminal output, and browser observations are raw evidence. They become usable actor state only after import into one of:

- command-board status / command record;
- child claim record;
- `canonical.event.v1` accepted event;
