{"eventId":"evt-000119","eventKind":"doc_section.upsert.v1","status":"accepted","decidedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:00+09:00","artifactPath":".agents/lease-ownership.md","sectionOrder":1,"sectionId":".agents-lease-ownership.md::0001::1.-Lease-lifecycle","headingDepth":2,"headingText":"1. Lease lifecycle","headingPath":["Lease, Ownership, and Duplicate Run Prevention","1. Lease lifecycle"],"content":"## 1. Lease lifecycle

```text
lease.acquire.v1
  -> lease.heartbeat.v1
  -> lease.release.v1 | lease.expire.v1 | lease.revoke.v1
```

A lease names:

- resource id;
- run id;
- owning actor;
- parent actor;
- authority scope;
- idempotency key;
- acquiredAt;
- expiresAt;
- heartbeat interval.

