{"artifactPath":".agents/canonical-event-log.md","byteSize":2820,"content":"# Canonical Event Log and A2UI Projection

This rule package fully adopts the durable actor-workflow gap analysis: the shared board is useful, but the durable truth is not the UI shape. A2UI is a projection protocol for live viewing. A2UI MUST NOT be treated as canonical truth.

